{"sha": "443daf03f90ae89b37a3953c14b83937a7d61bdfdda44269942b026e8e43210d", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:guided-waves} 章 --- 导行波与谐振腔}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:1}", "$f_n = nc/2a = 7.5$、$15$、\\qty{22.5}{GHz}。在 \\qty{12}{GHz} 处只有 $n = 1$：$k_g =", "(2\\pi/c)\\sqrt{f^2 - f_1^2} = \\qty{196}{rad/m}$，$\\lambda_g = \\qty{3.2}{cm}$，$v_\\varphi = c/0.78", "= \\qty{3.8e8}{m/s}$，$v_g = \\qty{2.3e8}{m/s}$。在 \\qty{6}{GHz} 处：$\\ell = c/2\\pi\\sqrt{f_1^2 -", "f^2} = \\qty{1.1}{cm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:2}", "TE$_{10}$ \\qty{6.55}{GHz}，TE$_{20}$ \\qty{13.1}{GHz}，TE$_{01}$ \\qty{14.7}{GHz}：单模工作", "区为 $6.55$ 至 \\qty{13.1}{GHz}。在 \\qty{10}{GHz} 处：$\\sqrt{1 - (6.55/10)^2} =", "0.756$，$\\lambda_g = \\qty{4.0}{cm}$，$v_g = 0.76c$，$\\cos\\theta = 0.756$，$\\theta = \\qty{41}{\\degree}$。", "$b \\approx a/2$ 使 TE$_{01}$ 仍高于 TE$_{20}$（最宽的单模频带），", "同时为场留出最大间隙（决定击穿前的功率容量）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:3}", "$f = 1.5 \\times 10^8\\sqrt{(m/0.3)^2 + (n/0.3)^2 + (p/0.2)^2}$：\\qty{0.71}{GHz}、\\qty{0.90}{GHz}、", "\\qty{1.35}{GHz}、\\qty{1.95}{GHz}。$N = 8\\pi Vf^3/3c^3 = 8\\pi \\times 0.018 \\times 1.56 \\times 10^{28}/", "8.1 \\times 10^{25} \\approx 260$。立方腔：$f = c\\sqrt2/2L$，$L = \\qty{2.3}{cm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:4}", "$\\mathrm{NA} = \\sqrt{1.48^2 - 1.46^2} = 0.24$，\\qty{14}{\\degree}；$\\Delta t = (n_1L/c)(n_1/n_2", "- 1) = \\qty{68}{ns/km}$；\\qty{2}{km} 上为 \\qty{135}{ns}：\\qty{7}{Mbit/s}；取 $0.003$ 时：", "\\qty{10}{ns/km}，\\qty{50}{Mbit/s}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:5}", "(a) $\\underline B_y = (k_g/\\omega)\\underline E$，$\\underline B_z = (\\iu/\\omega)\\partial_y\\underline E = (\\iu\\pi/a\\omega)", "E_0\\cos(\\pi y/a)\\eu^{\\iu(\\omega t - k_gz)}$：二者相位正交。(b) 在 $y = 0$ 处，$B_y = 0$，且", "$\\vect j_s = \\vect e_y\\wedge\\vect B/\\mu_0 = (B_z/\\mu_0)\\vect e_x$：沿场的方向。(c)", "$\\langle\\Pi_z\\rangle = E_0^2k_g\\sin^2(\\pi y/a)/2\\mu_0\\omega$，单位宽度的功率", "为 $E_0^2k_ga/4\\mu_0\\omega$；$\\langle\\Pi_y\\rangle \\propto \\operatorname{Re}(\\underline E\\,\\iu\\underline B_z^*)", "= 0$。(d) 单位长度与单位宽度上的平均能量为 $\\tfrac14\\varepsilon_0E_0^2a$（电", "场与磁场各占 $\\tfrac18\\varepsilon_0E_0^2a$）；二者之比为 $c^2k_g/\\omega = v_g$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:6}", "(a) $f_1 = \\qty{150}{GHz} \\gg f$：$\\ell \\approx a/\\pi = \\qty{0.32}{mm}$；$\\eu^{-0.5/0.32}$：", "按振幅计为 \\qty{-14}{dB}，按功率计为 $-27$。(b) $f_1 = \\qty{750}{MHz}$；在 \\qty{100}{MHz} 处", "$\\ell = \\qty{6.4}{cm}$ 时，一米内 \\qty{-136}{dB}。(c) $f_1 = \\qty{15}{GHz}$，$\\ell =", "\\qty{3.2}{mm}$：\\qty{27}{dB/cm}。(d) 波无法传播；", "倏逝性源于几何结构，而非耗散。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:7}", "(a) $P = \\tfrac14\\varepsilon_0cE_0^2ab\\sqrt{1 - f_{10}^2/f^2} = \\qty{120}{kW}$。(b) 放大 $\\times9$：", "\\qty{1}{MW}；加压氮气或 SF$_6$ 可提高击穿场强。(c)", "$j_s \\approx E_0/\\mu_0c = \\qty{2.7}{kA/m}$；$\\tfrac12R_sj_s^2 = \\qty{9e4}{W/m^2}$，在 $2a =", "\\qty{0.046}{m^2}$ 上，每米 \\qty{4}{kW/m}，即每米 $3.5\\%$，约 \\qty{0.15}{dB/m}。", "(d) 损耗比电缆低三倍，功率可达兆瓦级，", "而非千瓦级。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:8}", "(a) $f = c\\sqrt2/2L = \\qty{2.12}{GHz}$。(b) $\\delta = \\qty{1.4}{\\micro m}$，$R_s = \\qty{12}{m\\ohm}$；", "$W = \\varepsilon_0E_0^2V/8 = \\qty{1.1e-15}{}E_0^2$；$P = \\tfrac12R_s(E_0/377)^2 \\times 6L^2 =", "\\qty{2.5e-9}{}E_0^2$：$Q = \\omega W/P \\approx 6000$。(c) \\qty{360}{kHz}；\\qty{0.45}{\\micro s}。(d)", "$Q \\sim 10^{10}$：数十兆伏每米的场只需", "千瓦级功率维持，而非吉瓦级。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:9}", "格点 $(m, n, p)$ 满足 $m^2 + n^2 + p^2 \\le (2fL/c)^2$，", "占据球体的八分之一，即 $\\tfrac18\\cdot\\tfrac43\\pi(2fL/c)^3$，乘以两种偏振：", "$8\\pi L^3f^3/3c^3$。(b) $8\\pi f^2/c^3$。(c) $9 \\times 10^{-7}$ 每赫兹（约每兆赫一个，", "在 \\qty{1}{GHz} 处）；在 \\qty{500}{THz} 处为 $2 \\times 10^5$ 每赫兹。(d) 当模式", "间距超过其宽度时，模式是分立的；在微波炉中，每", "隔约 \\qty{10}{MHz} 一个，位于 \\qty{2.45}{GHz} 附近 --- 在", "几个百分点之内有数十个。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:10}", "(a) 由 $\\operatorname{\\vect{curl}}\\vect E = -\\partial_t\\vect B$：", "\\[", "\\underline B_x = -\\frac{k_g}\\omega\\underline E , \\qquad", "\\underline B_z = \\frac{\\iu\\pi}{a\\omega}E_0\\cos\\frac{\\pi x}a\\,\\eu^{\\iu(\\omega t - k_gz)} ,", "\\]", "且 $\\partial_xB_x + \\partial_zB_z = -(k_g\\pi/a\\omega)E_0\\cos(\\pi x/a) + (k_g\\pi/a\\omega)E_0", "\\cos(\\pi x/a) = 0$。(b) $(\\operatorname{\\vect{curl}}\\vect B)_y = \\partial_zB_x - \\partial_xB_z =", "(\\iu/\\omega)(k_g^2 + \\pi^2/a^2)\\underline E = (\\iu\\omega/c^2)\\underline E$：$k_g^2 = \\omega^2/c^2 - \\pi^2/a^2$。", "(c) 宽壁：$\\vect j_s = \\pm(B_z\\vect e_x - B_x\\vect e_z)/\\mu_0$ --- 沿 $z$ 方向的分量", "按 $\\sin(\\pi x/a)$ 变化，横向分量按 $\\cos(\\pi x/a)$ 变化（在中心处为零）；窄壁：", "仅沿 $y$ 方向。(d) 沿中心的纵向缝隙只切断横向电流，", "而该处横向电流为零；横向缝隙切断", "纵向电流并辐射，即缝隙波导天线。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:11}", "(a) $2a\\sqrt{n_1^2 - n_2^2}/\\lambda = 2 \\times 50 \\times 0.242/1.5 \\approx 16$，每种偏振。", "(b) $a < \\lambda/2\\mathrm{NA} = \\qty{3.1}{\\micro m}$。(c) 数值孔径 $\\mathrm{NA} =", "0.12$ 的圆形纤芯，在 $d = 2.405\\lambda/\\pi\\mathrm{NA} = \\qty{10}{\\micro m}$ 以下为单模：", "即 \\qty{9}{\\micro m} 的标准规格。(d) 掠射光线总是被全反射，", "因此最低阶模在每个频率下都存在，其倏逝尾部仅", "向包层中延伸。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:guided-waves:12}", "(a) 偏轴光线大部分时间处于折射率较低处，", "该处光速较快：较长的路径得到了补偿。(b) $n(r)\\cos\\theta = n_1\\cos\\theta_0$，", "其中 $n \\approx n_1(1 - \\Delta r^2/a^2)$ 与 $\\cos\\theta \\approx 1 - \\theta^2/2$：$(\\dd r/\\dd z)^2 =", "\\theta_0^2 - 2\\Delta r^2/a^2$，为简谐振动 $r = r_0\\sin(\\sqrt{2\\Delta}\\,z/a)$。", "(c) $2\\pi a/\\sqrt{2\\Delta} = \\qty{1.1}{mm}$。(d) $n_1L\\Delta^2/2c = \\qty{0.25}{ns/km}$，相对", "\\qty{49}{ns/km}，优两百倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:guided-waves:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $c/2a = \\qty{1.74}{GHz}$；TE$_{20}$ 与 TE$_{01}$：\\qty{3.49}{GHz}：仅", "TE$_{10}$ 在 \\qty{2.45}{GHz} 处传播。", ""]}